                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thank you to @AmDiabetesAssn for having me at their National Obesity Policy Forum to discuss the importance of preventative care and treating obesity. \n\nBy passing my bill, the Treat and Reduce Obesity Act, we can take the first step towards Medicare coverage of obesity treatments and a healthier nation.",
